---
layout: "base.njk"
title: "Clients & Experience"
description: "View the diverse clientele and project experience of KWAADJEI VALUATION HUB, showcasing our track record with financial institutions, public bodies, and corporate clients across Ghana."
---

<div class="about-main-content hero-banner" style="background-image: url(/assets/images/cta-bg-4.jpg);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-12 text-center">
        <div class="content position-relative">
          <h4 class="text-light fw-bold">CLIENTS & EXPERIENCE</h4>
          <div class="line-dec mx-auto"></div>
          <h2 class="fw-bold text-light">A Proven Track Record of Trust</h2>
          <p class="text-light lead">
            We provide nationwide services and represent clients who use our reports for transactions both in and outside Ghana.
            Our firm has rich experience in Valuation, Facilities Management, and Land Administration.
          </p>
          <div class="main-button mt-4">
            <a href="/contact/">Partner With Us</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<div class="client-list-section py-5" style="background: #f7f9f7;">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-lg-8 offset-lg-2 text-center">
        <div class="section-heading mb-5">
          <h2 class="text-success fw-bold">Trusted By Ghana's Leading Institutions</h2>
          <p class="text-dark">
            We are proud to serve a diverse clientele of financial institutions, public bodies,
            corporations, and private individuals.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-md-6">
        <div class="client-card p-4 rounded-4 shadow-sm h-100">
